ly without music.", "s": 5.333, "e": 15.113}, {"text": "Within a month, roughly 400 townspeople had joined her, unable to stop even as their feet bled and many collapsed from exhaustion and heart attacks.", "s": 15.233, "e": 26.203}, {"text": "Local authorities bafflingly hired musicians to help them \"dance it out,\" which only made it worse.", "s": 26.323, "e": 33.141}, {"text": "Modern historians believe mass stress-induced hysteria triggered by famine caused the outbreak.", "s": 33.261, "e": 39.638}]}